## Key Risk Mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Product `catalogueLocationKeys` reference old `_key` values | Migration sets `_id = old _key` — product docs untouched |
| `catalogue-index.json` format changes break frontend | V3.3 structurally compares old vs new output |
| Tree reconstruction loses node ordering | `sortOrder` field preserves original array positions |
| Orphaned nodes or broken references | V2.1 validates every child ref resolves, checks counts |
| `Catalogue` TS type removed from auto-generated types | 5.1 replaces with standalone inline type before 5.2 regeneration |
| Regression in VFS query pattern | `catalogueLocationKeys[@ in $keys]` unchanged — keys are same values |
